    lomo:legalText "By way of further derogation from paragraph 3, point (d), the Member State concerned may allow fishing for European eel of an overall length of 12 cm or more when migrating from Union waters to their spawning grounds in the Sargasso Sea (downstream migration) for up to a total of 50 consecutive or non-consecutive days."@en .

